# 7.2 GB of Q tables and nested-sampling checkpoints, all regenerable from
# run_h0_scans.py / the sbatch wrappers.  The small JSONs under data/ are the
# measured record (h0 scans, n0 calibration and its provenance) and stay
# tracked -- data/ is deliberately NOT ignored wholesale for that reason.
*.h5
*.npz
*.npy
*.png

# SLURM logs land in logs/ next to the sbatch scripts.
logs/
*.out
*.err

__pycache__/
